            <p>Average sold prices in the Hollywood Riviera ran over $2.4 million in 2025, with many homes selling well above list. Days on market averaged just 8–35 days depending on pricing — this is a highly competitive sub-market where pre-approval and preparation are non-negotiable. <strong>Virtually all transactions here require jumbo financing.</strong> Note that the Hollywood Riviera uses Torrance schools and city services despite the Redondo Beach mailing address.</p>
